# PulseOps SaaS Rules
- Keep all code, deps, DB, and configs strictly inside projects/pulseops-saas/.
- Enforce workspace isolation (X-Workspace-Id) and RBAC (OWNER/ADMIN/ANALYST) on every business route.
- ANALYST is read-only (403 on write operations).
- Never hardcode mock data in apps/web; always fetch from apps/api.
- Always apply tabular-nums to financial numbers, percentages, and data tables.
- Maintain complete ZH/EN i18n and Light/Dark theme parity.
